    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "to hang on to",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "彼は給料引き上げを求めて、交渉で食い下がり続けた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "母親は子どもへの甘い物を許可するよう父親に食い下がった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "営業担当者は顧客に食い下がって、最後に契約を取った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "」と私が食い下がると、「そんなものがいったい何になる？",
              "citation": {
                "source": "緋のエチュード",
                "author": "A STUDY IN SCARLET",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「わたしのいまの質問は、いちばん重要なものですから、きょうの会見のさいごに、それだけはお答えください」　検事は、くいさがる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "金属人間",
                "author": "海野十三",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "そして、社長に遠まわしの皮肉をきりだすと同じようにオドオドと、しかし執拗にくいさがる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "水鳥亭",
                "author": "坂口安吾",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "そこで功兵衛は空想のなかでくいさがるだろう、――あんな男でもいつかは死病にとりつかれ、苦しみながら死ぬんだと思えば哀れだと考えられませんか。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "醜聞",
                "author": "山本周五郎",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "to hound",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "記者たちは政治家に食い下がり、真実を引き出そうとしていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "弁護士は証人に食い下がって、矛盾を突いた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "上司は部下に食い下がり、報告書の提出を催促した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "to grab the front of the opponent's mawashi, place one's head against their chest, and lower one's hips",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "力士は相手に食い下がり、前に出ていく戦法を取った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "大関は小結に食い下がって、有利な位置を確保した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "本気の取組で、彼は激しく食い下がり、相手を押し出した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
